# AI-Powered Iris Flower Predictor 🌸

A beginner-friendly machine learning app that predicts the species of an Iris flower (Setosa, Versicolor or Virginica) from its measurements. Built as the Module 05 mini project of the AI & Python internship at Codomax Digital.

## Features
- Trains a Random Forest model with Scikit-learn on the Iris dataset
- Shows the model's accuracy on unseen test data
- Takes flower measurements from the user and predicts the species with a confidence score
- Validates input so wrong values do not crash the app

## Tech Stack
- Python 3
- Scikit-learn

## How to Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python iris_predictor_app.py
```

## How This Improves the Previous Project
Module 04 trained a K-Nearest Neighbors model and only printed results. This version uses a Random Forest and adds an interactive prediction loop, input validation and confidence scores.

